    "/ Shipping":"/ 运费","Planning tool":"规划工具","Kakobuy shipping, without the fake precision.":"不制造虚假精确度的 Kakobuy 运费说明。","A useful estimate starts with chargeable weight—not a viral “price per kilo.” Enter actual weight and parcel dimensions, then treat the result as a range until Kakobuy shows eligible live routes.":"有用的估算应从计费重量开始，而不是照搬网络上的“每公斤价格”。输入实际重量和尺寸，并在 Kakobuy 显示可用实时线路前将结果视为区间。","What moves the quote":"哪些因素会影响报价","Actual weight":"实际重量","Scale measurement":"称重结果","Volumetric weight":"体积重量","L × W × H ÷ divisor":"长 × 宽 × 高 ÷ 系数","Route eligibility":"线路适用性","Country + item type":"国家 + 商品类型","First-weight step":"首重档位","Initial charge block":"初始计费档位","Additional steps":"续重档位","Each added 0.5/1 kg":"每增加 0.5／1 公斤","Surcharges":"附加费用","Fuel, remote area, handling":"燃油、偏远地区、操作费","Coupon":"优惠券","Only if route + threshold match":"仅在线路和门槛匹配时生效","Decision sequence":"决策顺序","Reduce cost in the right order.":"按正确顺序降低成本。","A lower quote should not create a higher loss risk. Inspect first, consolidate carefully, then optimize packaging and route.":"降低报价不应增加损失风险。应先验货、谨慎合箱，再优化包装与线路。","Resolve QC problems":"先解决 QC 问题","Control parcel volume":"控制包裹体积","Read route details":"阅读线路详情",
