    "Are customs and taxes included in the shipping quote?":"Dogana e tasse sono incluse?","Sometimes a route is described as tax-free or duty-handled, while other routes leave import charges to the recipient. The answer depends on the destination and exact line. Read the live route description and declared-value rules rather than relying on a general social-media answer.":"Dipende da destinazione e linea. Alcune rotte gestiscono tasse o dazi, altre lasciano i costi al destinatario. Leggi condizioni e regole di dichiarazione aggiornate.",
